  "bodyText": "Home\nVisit Us\nExhibitions\nEvents\nOnline Talks\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nCollections\nBlog\nResearch\nLearning\nShop\nCart\nMy Account\nAbout\nBecome a Friend\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\n\n01993 810 210\n\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\n  \nHome\nEvents\nExhibitions\nCollections\nFriends’ Membership\nVisit\nShop\nBasket\nMy Account\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nResearch\nLearning\nOnline Talks\nBlog\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\nImage Services\nAbout\nMAKE A PAPER MOSAIC OF POPPIES - COMPETITION WINNERS!\n\nWe're delighted to announce that the winners of our competition are:\n\n5th Didcot Brownies, Squirrel Six, for the older age group, with their wonderful depiction of the iconic WW1 soldier standing with poppies\n\nand\n\n5th Abingdon Rainbows, Group Three, for the younger age group. They made a very clever design interweaving poppies round a cross.\n\nWe had over 100 entries and the standard was amazing!\n\nEach of the children involved in the winning entries receives a family annual pass to the Museum.\n\n \n\n \n\nSoldiers of Oxfordshire Museum\nPark Street.\nWoodstock\nOxfordshire OX20 1SN\n\nPhone and Email:\nGeneral Enquiries & Event Tickets: 01993 810 211\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms and conditions",
